0779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-04-22T16:54:03Z","updated_at":"2025-04-27T11:12:56Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.4.1 and 4.4\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - Fedora Linux 41 (KDE Plasma) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 Ti (nvidia; 570.133.07) - AMD Ryzen 7 4800H with Radeon Graphics (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen I set `TextEdit.text` at runtime it triggers the `lines_edited_from` signal, but the `reaction signal method` gets called twice.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Connect to the `TextEdit.lines_edited_from` signal to a `Callable`.\n\n2. Edit the `TextEdit.text` property at runtime:\n`text_edit.text = \"SOMETHING\"`\n\n3. The `Callable` gets called twice\n\n**Note:**\nThis doesn't happen when editing the Text normally within the game. It only happens when setting it at runtime.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[textedit_calls__on_code_edit_lines_edited_from_twice.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19853921/textedit_calls__on_code_edit_lines_edited_from_twice.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105659/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105659/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}